        "type": "narrative",
        "paragraphs": [
          "- Primary rodding inputs include used anodes, rods, stubs, cast iron, graphite, compressed air, cooling water, and molten/aluminum holding support where coating steps require it.\n- The wider company context also ties rodding performance to upstream green and baking operations, because anode quality and transport readiness directly affect rod joining outcomes.\n- [To validate - exact rodding consumable balance - source tables do not quantify material consumption by step]"
